<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="OBA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Obadia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Obadia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Obadia</para>
  <para style="mt1">Obadia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Obadia chekhai, now arui khin dow 840 BC khe chekhai. Sangbowk Laitawm Prim kowi kowh risiuüa bowih kowi risi Obadia bowih dow bowkbowk lak-e kowh lang sowm mih bowih chekhai. Risi Obadia bowih kowi arui uowi mih dow Edawmuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Edawmuüa dow Isak kowh chapa phir Jakawb kowh taimow Esau kowh chuprek chaprekuüa chekhai. Amatni dow Jakawb chuprek chaprek Israeluüa hown taichow nauchow chowdiah. Tawkchedow Edawmuüa mih amatni tainau Juda pren kowi kowh uowi mih Israeluüa hown ransu prim chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Babulawnuüa uang senah khe kowh Israeluüa piak mih khi hanow Edawmuüa mih lainowmma tawi awmrawm khai. Nami klen kowi amatni dow Jerusalem kowh ransu Babulawnuüa kowi tawi khowngah khai, now Jerusalem kowh dawngthawnguan ün tawi takhün büah khai. Naiawng rakowi Edawmuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih lawnguan mami bowih kowi risi Obadia tekla khai. Amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG nachumta bowk kown. Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowi dow nalawngah hanow Edawmuüa kowh pren napeah kown mih CHAKRAMANG khamah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jerusalem sum pre kat chekhai. Pakat mih dow mang Jehoram chowm mang mih khin khe Edawmuüa rut kowi chekhai. Nami dow 848-841 BC khe chekhai (2 Manguüa 8:20-22, 2 Krungchakuüa 21:8-20). Now pakat mih dow 586 BC khe Babulawnuüa rut kowi chekhai. Tawkche Jerusalem tawng khe kowh sum mih rakowi chow Edawmuüa napiak kown mih laiklow Obadia tek mih tukah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Bawrima mih Edawm kowi nape khamah sum kown mih 1:1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Edawm napiak kown mih 1:5-9</para>
  <para style="io1">Edawm nasum kown mih auan 1:10-14</para>
  <para style="io1">Edawm kowh ripra 1:15-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel hai Juda kowi naplan thawpah iawk kown mih 1:17-21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="OBA 1" />
  <para style="s">Edawmuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="OBA 1:1" />Mami dow Edawm pren lawnguan kowi Obadia kowi CHAKRAMANG uang tüng pe mukmang mih laiklow chekhai. Nami mukmang kowi kramamu tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:1">“Chu, a-i bowkbowk kamrüt lah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:1">Chu, a-i kowh siphaiuüa kowi kuala hanow kowsen Edawm lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="OBA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="OBA 1:2" />Edawmuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:2">“Mü büah, chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi lang sowm mih chenchap ang nathawp enni kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:2">enni kowi dow mapaw maru nanü naklowk enni kown nadowi.<verse eid="OBA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="OBA 1:3" />Enni kowh marow kri dow tapat lut huamang hown enni kawm pe tap khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:3">Enni kowh kim ün dow hungh iawng alowngma enni thawpah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:3">Naiawng rakowi sakdawng kowi tatuak se maiawng enni chang bawri khai:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:3">‘Amia iawng mih paw uang nowng sen anging dowi bowt,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:3">Tawkche enni matia kowi enni takuan mih chekhai.<verse eid="OBA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="OBA 1:4" />Uamu lak-e alowngma kowi enni nowng iow chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:4">mukuang kowi kowh krek dawng kowi enni cham chang kim chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:4">enni kowi dow nami hownia ang nauang klala enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:4">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="OBA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="OBA 1:5-6" />Enni purdowng kowi kowh phih nauang towm kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:5-6">Kuk mih hai damrauüa khowm padow amatni nauah mih krowngchow taih pawla reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:5-6">now grep uih klek miuüa paw katpaw klekla bowk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:5-6">Nachenganchepaw enni kowh ransu-uüa dow nalutta enni kriakria kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:5-6">tawngpaw nata towla enni kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:5-6">Esau krungchak Edawmuüa cham petta mih dawngthawnguan maten paw ransu-uüa nakrawi kata bowk kown.<verse eid="OBA 1:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="OBA 1:7" />Tangila enni mih pren maten dow enni matia pren hownia nakhün prüt enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:7">Enni kowh auiuauüa maten dow nakuan enni hanow piakra prakowi napakla enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:7">Enni hown kowh taiua cha taiua kham miuüa dow nachak enni leng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:7">Tawkche enni dow tawngpaw natuk kown nadowi.<verse eid="OBA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="OBA 1:8" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Edawm maru-uüa kowi ang ripah mih ni khe chanlaima miuüa kowi ang nakowngta pe bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:8">now Edawm hungh kowi kowh prengia uowima miuüa kowi paw ang nachumta pe kown.<verse eid="OBA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="OBA 1:9" />Aw Teman marow, en kowh tasen kiakma miuüa dow lainowmma natakrow takrai kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:9">Edawm hungh kowi kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi dow ang nakowngta pe bowk kown.<verse eid="OBA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edawmuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG ripah mih auan</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="OBA 1:10" />“En tainau Israeluüa kowi en changah anowng khai rakowi en narukrai kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:10">En dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi napiak kown.<verse eid="OBA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="OBA 1:11" />Akeng chenchapuüa mih uang khue Jerusalem tap hanow alak kowi uang kup khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:11">Israeluüa kowh dawngthawnguan maten amatni dow pawla pe bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:11">Nami dawngthawnguan dow kuak pe plang now ransu-uüa taretah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:11">Nami khin khe en paw en matia bak natawi paw kownkow amatni ria kowi en tawi chawng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:11">En paw akeng chenchapuüa hown mapaw lang taklowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="OBA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="OBA 1:12" />En tainau-uüa kla phih mih khin khe en renah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:12">Judauüa piak mih lawnguan kowi en awmrawmla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:12">now en tainau-uüa kawmkrat mih khin khe en chang bawri khai.<verse eid="OBA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="OBA 1:13" />Ang maru-uüa kla phih mih khin khe tapplawt hownia en kowtawi kup khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:13">Amatni kla phih mih en khi hanow lainowmma en awmrawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:13">Amatni kowh dawngthawnguan dow en kowtawi takhün khai.<verse eid="OBA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="OBA 1:14" />Ang maru-uüa kla phih khe kowh ia powt miuüa kowi paw nakhümah kownkow tiama towng kowi en hawt pawmah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:14">ia plai miuüa kowi paw khümah now ransu-uüa rut kowi en cham ap-ah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:14">Naiawngün en nachang kown mih mapaw taka dowi chowdiah.<verse eid="OBA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edawm piak mih hai Israel plan iung mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="OBA 1:15" />“Edawmuüa low, chenchap maten vüi ang kowh tara chetra ni uang tawn khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:15">Maru kowi enni changah iawng enni kowi paw nachang enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:15">enni kowh lup sung dow enni luk kowi nauang ting ngengche kown.<verse eid="OBA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="OBA 1:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow mih Hebrai lai hown arui uowi mih chim dowi chekhai.</char>
    </note> Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow ang kowh chimsaima hungh kowi ang kowh kunmaraura bia hownia en kham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:16">nami iawng dow ang maru-uüa riaret kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa kowi paw ang kowh kunmaraura bia hownia ang nape khamah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:16">Amatni dow nakham hanow nachum bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:16">aliu khowm nata lat kown nadowi.<verse eid="OBA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="OBA 1:17" />Nachenganchepaw Zaiawn hungh dow ta plai miuüa vüi chimsaima mih tatung tanimra nachowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:17">amatni dow Thurai vüi kowi kowh lang kloah mih maru naown büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:17">Israel chuprek chaprekuüa dow amatni kowh dawngthawnguan vüi bak naplan ka iawk kown.<verse eid="OBA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="OBA 1:18" />Jakawb chuprek chaprekuüa hai Josef chuprek chaprekuüa dow maih iawng naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:18">now Esau chuprek chaprekuüa dow chida cheng iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:18">Maih dow nami chida cheng kowi nakamah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:18">Esau chuprek chaprekuüa dow miapaw nata lat kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:18">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="OBA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="OBA 1:19" />Juda tawngphak pra kowh uowi mih ang maru-uüa dow Edawmuüa pren napowng büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:19">now satkup pra kowh hungh dak kowi uowi mih Israeluüa dow Filistinuüa pren napowng büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:19">Israeluüa mih Efraimuüa uowi rah hai Samariuüa uowi rah maten napowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:19">now Benjaminuüa dow Gileaduüa kowh uowi rah napowng kown.<verse eid="OBA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="OBA 1:20" />Cham takhang mih Israeluüa dow nauang plan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:20">now Kananuüa uowi rah Zarefat marow mowr nauang powng büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="OBA 1:20">Tawngphak pra kowh pren kowi cham takhang mih Jerusalem maru-uüa paw nauang plan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:20">now tawngphak pra kowh Judauüa uowi rah nauang powng büah kown.<verse eid="OBA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="OBA 1:21" />Takhangra hownia ka lawngra mih Israeluüa dow Zaiawn hungh hownia Edawmuüa pren maten kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi nakruitownah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="OBA 1:21">now CHAKRAMANG dow amatni luk kowi nachowm mang kown.<verse eid="OBA 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="OBA 1" />
</usx>